    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "저 네일이",
      "en": "Those nails..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "버티다 못해 부러진",
      "en": "were the ones that couldn't hold on anymore and broke."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나의 손톱이야",
      "en": "They're my broken nails."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잘 담겨있군",
      "en": "They sure showed up clearly."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "향수 머 뿌려요 애기",
      "en": "What perfume do you use, baby?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 맞아 나 향수 바꿀거야",
      "en": "Oh right, I'm actually going to change my perfume."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "추천해줘",
      "en": "Recommend me one."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나는",
      "en": "Personally,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "참고로",
      "en": "for reference,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "은은한",
      "en": "I like"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "코튼플라워 느낌",
      "en": "soft cotton-flower scents."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "조아",
      "en": "I love those."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오오",
      "en": "Ooh."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "다 메모해둘게",
      "en": "I'll write all of those down."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "지금은 살짝 달달한 꽃",
      "en": "Right now I'm using a slightly sweet floral scent,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "쓰고있긴한데",
      "en": "though."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어젠가",
      "en": "The other day,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "유연언니랑 얘기하다가",
      "en": "I was talking with Yuyeon unnie,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "야너 향수뭐야",
      "en": "and she asked, 'Hey, what perfume are you wearing?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러길래",
      "en": "So I thought,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좋아서 그러는줄랄았는데",
      "en": "'Oh, she must like it.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내스타일 아님.",
      "en": "Then she said, 'Not my style.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이럼…..",
      "en": "That's what she said..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 좋데",
      "en": "But she said it still smelled nice."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅌㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅌㄹㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 나도",
      "en": "But honestly,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "향수 좀",
      "en": "I get tired of perfumes"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "빨리 질려",
      "en": "pretty quickly."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "한번 내가 쓴 향수",
      "en": "Once I've used one for a while,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "다시 못돌아가",
      "en": "I can't really go back to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "코에 너무 익숙해서",
      "en": "My nose just gets too used to the scent."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "언니 코튼허그 아직 써ㅓㅓ?",
      "en": "Unnie, are you still using Cotton Hug?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "유일하게 그건 다씀!",
      "en": "That's the only one I've ever completely finished!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "우리 향수얘기하니까",
      "en": "Talking about perfume like this,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭔가",
      "en": "kind of"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "클래식하고",
      "en": "feels classy"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어 좀",
      "en": "and..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "교양있어보이네",
      "en": "makes us seem sophisticated."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "채팅방에서",
      "en": "It's like"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "향기가 나지",
      "en": "the chatroom even smells nice."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "나는 만두향이 제일 좋아",
      "en": "I like the smell of dumplings the most."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "갑저기 만두냄새 훅났어..",
      "en": "I suddenly imagined the smell of dumplings..."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "나는 지하철 델리만쥬향",
      "en": "I like the smell of Delimanjoo at the subway station."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "와 학교끝나고 맨날 명동역에서 나는냄새",
      "en": "Wow, that's the smell that was always at Myeongdong Station after school."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "학교끝나고 맨날 명동역 가는거야?",
      "en": "Did you go to Myeongdong Station every day after school?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내학교가 남산타워야…",
      "en": "My school was basically at Namsan Tower..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 곧 졸업이라니",
      "en": "I can't believe graduation is coming soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "노랑 학교 못떠나 ㅠㅠㅠ",
      "en": "I don't want to leave my schoolㅠㅠㅠ"
    },
        {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "아직 1년 남았어",
      "en": "You've still got one more year left."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅇㅋ",
      "en": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "편입 갈까 싷은데 리라어떰",
      "en": "I'm thinking about transferring. How's Lila?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "장점 하연이가 있음",
      "en": "Pros: Hayeon is there."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "단점 1년뒤에 사라짐.",
      "en": "Cons: She'll be gone in a year."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "응응",
      "en": "Yep."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "촌캉스 가면 하고 싶었던 거 있어?",
      "en": "Is there anything you've wanted to do during Countryside getaway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "헐 맞다",
      "en": "Oh, right!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "촌캉스",
      "en": "Countryside getaway."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뽑혔더라",
      "en": "I got picked for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "재밌겠다",
      "en": "It's going to be fun."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "넥글조합끼리만",
      "en": "We've never had just the NXT Glow members together before,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "있어본적이",
      "en": "so"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "없어서",
      "en": "this will be the first time."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어떨까 기대됨",
      "en": "I'm excited to see what it'll be like."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "촌캉스에서 울거같은 멤버 누구있어?",
      "en": "Who do you think is most likely to cry during Countryside getaway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "만약 뭐",
      "en": "If there's something like..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "Vv처럼",
      "en": "like VV,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "편지다",
      "en": "where everyone writes letters,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그러면",
      "en": "then..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "안봐도 비디오",
      "en": "it's obvious."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "김주빈",
      "en": "Kim Joobin."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "바로울지",
      "en": "She'd start crying immediately."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난",
      "en": "As for me..."
