    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭔갈 노리고 일부로 안운곤 아니구",
      "en": "It's not like I'm deliberately trying not to cry."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그냥",
      "en": "It's just that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "감동받았어 슬퍼",
      "en": "I can be touched or feel sad,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래도",
      "en": "but even then,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "눈뮬 안나",
      "en": "the tears just don't come out."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "그럼 어떨때 눈물나???",
